{
  "title": "Dua for the Nineth Hour",
  "code": "012",
  "data": "The ninth hour, which is the space of time between the Afternoon Prayer up to two hours after that, is dedicated to Imam Muhammad ibn Ali al-Taqi (a). The supplication at this hour is as follows:\nيَا مَنْ دَعَاهُ الْمُضْطَرُّوْنَ فَاَجَابَهُمْ وَالْتَجَاَ اِلَيْهِ الْخَاۤئِفُوْنَ فَاَمَنَهُمْ وَعَبَدَهُ الطَّاۤئِعُوْنَ فَشَكَرَهُمْ وَ شَكَرَهُ الْمُؤْمِنُوْنَ فَحَبَاهُمْ وَ اَطَاعُوْهُ فَعَصَمَهُمْ وَ سَئَلُوْهُ فَاَعْطَاهُمْ وَ نَسُوْا نِعْمَتَهُ فَلَمْ يُخْلِ شُكْرَهُ مِنْ قُلُوْبِهِمْ وَامْتَنَّ عَلَيْهِمْ فَلَمْ يَجْعَلِ اسْمَهُ مَنْسِيًّا عِنْدَهُمْ اَسْئَلُكَ بِحَقِّ مُحَمَّدِ بْنِ عَلِيٍّ عَلَيْهِمَا السَّلَامُ حُجَّتِكَ الْبَالِغَةِ وَ نِعْمَتِكَ السَّابِغَةِ وَ مَحَجَّتِكَ الْوَاضِحَةِ وَ اُقَدِّمُهُ بَيْنَ يَدَيْ حَوَاۤئِجِيْ اَنْ تُصَلِّيَ عَلٰى مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اٰلِ مُحَمَّدٍ وَّ اَنْ تَفْعَلَ بِيْ كَذَا وَ كَذَا۔\nYAA MAN DA-A'AHUL MUDTARROONA FA-AJAABAHUM, WAL TAJA-A ILAYHIL KHAAA-IFOONA FA-AMANAHUM, WA A'BADAHUT TAAA-I'OONA FA-SHAKARAHUM, WA SHAKARAHUL MU'MINOONA FA-HABAAHUM, WA ATAA-O'OHU FA-A'SAMAHUM, WA SA-ALOOHU FA-A'TAAHUM, WA NASOO NI'MATAHU FA-LAM YUKHLI SHUKRAHU MIN QULOOBIHIM, WAM TANNA A'LAYHIM FA-LAM YAJ-A'LIS MAHU MANSIYYAN I'NDAHUM, AS-ALUKA BI-HAQQI MUHAMMADIBNI A'LIYYIN A'LAYHIMAS SALAAM, HUJJATIKAL BAALIGHAH, WA NI'MATIKAS SAABIGHAH, WA MAHAJJATIKAL WAADIHAH, WA UQADDIMUHU BAYNA YADAY HAWAAA-IJEE, AN TUSALLIYA A'LAA MUHAMMADIN WA AALI MUHAMMADIN WA AN TAF-A'LA BEE KAZAA WA KAZAA.\nO He Whom the distressed call upon, and He answers them; to Whom the fearful take refuge, and He grants them safety; Whom the obedient worship, and He rewards them; Whom the believers thank, and He grants them; whom they obey, and He preserves them; whom they ask, and He gives them; who forgot His blessing, yet He never emptied their hearts of gratitude to Him, and He favored them, yet never let His name be forgotten among them. I beseech You by the right of Muhammad ibn Ali, upon both of them be peace, Your conclusive proof, Your abundant blessing, and Your clear path, and I present him before my needs, that You bless Muhammad and the Household of Muhammad, and that You do for me such-and-such.\nYou may now mention your needs."
}
